{"id": "34325", "title": "鬼迷心窍", "author": "白玉虹", "category": "文学名著", "count": 43, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34325.htm", "intro": "刚搬进新居、头一个夜晚，他就……撞见鬼了！？而且还是只容貌清丽的、吐长舌头的、会嘲笑他的吊死鬼！咦？他、他摸得到她的「身体」微微的凉……鬼……原来并不如想像中那样可怕呀，连向来胆小的他都敢跟她杠上了——哼！谁教她初次见面就开口要他帮忙！也不去探听探听，他可是素有精明之誉的商人，没有利益的事，他哪可能会做！正义感？没有！ 同情心？没有！ 良心？被狗啃了！ 所以，帮忙的事就甭谈了。可是，为什么最后他还是……帮了？而且帮得心甘情愿！莫非他……中邪了？！", "base": "files/article/html/34/34325", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2181559.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2181560.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2181561.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2181562.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2181563.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2181564.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2181565.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2181566.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2181567.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2181568.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2181569.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2181570.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2181571.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2181572.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2181573.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2181574.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2181575.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2181576.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2181577.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2181578.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2181579.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2181580.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2181581.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2181582.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2181583.